### obtener varios
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

### intentar guardar sin token
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products/create
User-Agent: rest-client
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title":"Placa de video GPU AMD RX 9070 XT",
    "price":90000,
    "stock":2
}

### guardar un producto con token
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products/create
User-Agent: rest-client
Authorization: Bearer {{var_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title":"Joystick Nacon Revolution Pro Max FullHD",
    "price":35750,
    "stock":2
}

### Eliminar producto
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/W5pa6YMQuGYDp4y0suFd
Authorization: Bearer {{var_token}}
